{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prichal</strong> is a psychological horror game with co-op support for up to 4 players. As a Synchronizer Agent, you will venture into distorted locations trapped within a time loop. Your mission is to uncover the cause of these temporal rifts and eliminate them\u2014all while evading the Spawns of Dissonance.<br><br>You are elite agents of Project Chronos, a secret alliance of scientists, historians, military personnel, and financiers. Using an experimental device, you must infiltrate broken time loops created by Dissonance\u2014a metaphysical dimension of chaos. Complete missions across diverse locations and uncover the horrific secrets that cause time to stand still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Friends</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/93e15d69c1768b979f264695a30d96f0.poster.avif?t=1771875405\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/93e15d69c1768b979f264695a30d96f0.webm?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/93e15d69c1768b979f264695a30d96f0.mp4?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your mission with up to three other agents. Distribute roles and work together to overcome the dangers lurking within the treacherous time loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Unknown</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/64b8480deab7ccd3044e1a9f30479729.poster.avif?t=1771875405\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/64b8480deab7ccd3044e1a9f30479729.webm?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/64b8480deab7ccd3044e1a9f30479729.mp4?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam through haunted corridors, collect mysterious artifacts, and uncover chilling secrets. Choose from a variety of locations, each featuring its own unique atmosphere and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of the Entities</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/6441c23adf54a3407f9db34eef13c9fb.poster.avif?t=1771875405\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/6441c23adf54a3407f9db34eef13c9fb.webm?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid direct confrontations with the local inhabitants at all costs. Stealth and caution are your best allies if you want to make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in Terror</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/5587f591a44c8e3188d4d183f352c4fd.poster.avif?t=1771875405\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/5587f591a44c8e3188d4d183f352c4fd.webm?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/extras/5587f591a44c8e3188d4d183f352c4fd.mp4?t=1771875405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, <i>Prichal</i> delivers cutting-edge graphics and a hauntingly realistic atmosphere for ultimate immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains scenes with rapidly flashing lights and strobe effects. Individuals sensitive to light stimuli or suffering from epilepsy are advised to exercise caution.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4142480?t=1771875405","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4142480?t=1771875405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/9c62ac572564aa648fcec708f6177e6b151aacad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771875405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142480/9c62ac572564aa648fcec708f6177e6b151aacad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771875405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature content including violence, blood and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":4350950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prichal</strong> is a psychological horror game with co-op support for up to 4 players. As a Synchronizer Agent, you will venture into distorted locations trapped within a time loop. Your mission is to uncover the cause of these temporal rifts and eliminate them\u2014all while evading the Spawns of Dissonance.<br><br>You are elite agents of Project Chronos, a se